Subject: [PATCH] Them dieu khien bang joystick/thanh truot tren giao dien web
 (PC + dien thoai)

- RobotArm_6DOF: nhan lenh UART (USART1 BLE + USART2 laptop) bang DMA vong,
  lenh '6 goc', 'Sn:goc', 'Vtoc_do'; lam muot chuyen dong bang TIM2 100Hz;
  gioi han goc tung khop; tu khoi dong lai DMA khi loi UART
- control_ui: server aiohttp (WebSocket -> serial) + trang web responsive
  voi thanh truot, joystick ao, ho tro tay cam (Gamepad API), che do --sim
- README
